OL,7,     Fdrunkenness in the cubicles, the
OL,8,     Fvictim of a dog attack who might
OL,9,     Fhave a tooth in the wound, and a
OL,10,     Fpatient brought into resus via
OL,11,     Fambulance in a diabetic coma.
